@Gideon Sato, in the channel's history, your first report of the kiosks offline on 3 Aug is at **10:42 AM**: "gate kiosks offline at Vantorre's Hartford plant. Both inbound lanes showing a white screen after badge scan."

The only guard detail in that window is from the same 10:42 message: the guard was **writing trailer numbers on a clipboard**. Mateo's 11:03 AM message says kiosk 1 was back and the guard checked in trailer 8836, which dispatch could see. Nothing else in the channel describes the guard's activity.

Ticket SUP-5380 has an earlier entry at 08:12 ("Rebot failed; drivers queueing"). I can't tell from the record who logged it, so if the postmortem needs an earlier first report, check who filed that update.
